bots: declare the bot script commands (engine.rs2)

Progressive's two commands for bot players, appended to the command list like upstream:
p_isbot (1 if the active player is a bot; .p_isbot for the secondary player) and
p_bot_interact_trade (tell a bot that a player wants to trade: stage 0 begins, -1 resets).
The compiler binds them by name to the opcodes the overlay compiler registers
(P_ISBOT = 10100, P_BOT_INTERACT_TRADE = 10101, web/engine/bots/src/port/BotScriptCommands.ts).
Not carried over: Progressive's last_string, p_namedialog and map_feature (clans, GE, features).

